&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of navigating complex global markets (EMEA/APAC) and scaling partner ecosystems in diverse business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to analyze market data, make data-driven decisions, and manage ambiguous initiatives where the strategy may not yet be defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication and negotiation skills, with the ability to build trust and influence across all levels of an organization&lt;/li&gt;
