&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Senior NetSuite Engineer to own the architecture, scalability, and long-term evolution of our Financial Technology platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, high-ownership role for someone who operates as both a systems thinker and hands-on builder. You will define how our ERP ecosystem—and its surrounding systems—scale with the business, while directly contributing to implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not just advise on architecture—you will set direction, challenge constraints, and drive execution. This role requires someone who is equally comfortable defining multi-quarter architectural strategy (40% of the time)&amp;nbsp; and developing solutions (60% of the time) in complex, high-stakes systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Accomplish&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the end-to-end architecture of our NetSuite and financial system ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a multi-quarter architectural vision that balances flexibility, scalability, and operational simplicity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify systemic risks and proactively evolve the platform to prevent future constraints—not just react to current needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business stakeholders to design solutions and deliver technical implementations that align with business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for clean architecture, maintainable automation, and scalable system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and aggressively reduce tech debt, redundant logic, and fragile implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop end-to-end NetSuite solutions using declarative configuration (SuiteBuilder, SuiteFlow, Custom Records, and Saved Searches) and programmatic development (SuiteScript, SuiteTalk APIs, and SuiteCloud Development Framework).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and execute complex system redesigns (e.g., Zone Advanced Billing, advanced pricing/product modeling, OneWorld subsidiary structures, intercompany transactions, and replacing customizations with native functionality)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and support integrations between NetSuite (including OneWorld multi-subsidiary environments) and other enterprise applications, ensuring data consistency across entities, currencies, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formalize the NetSuite release management and deployment processes, including Sandbox strategy, SuiteBundler/SDF deployments, and CI/CD pipelines to be executed by team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve NetSuite issues, ensuring system stability, performance, and scalability across configurations and customizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7+ years of experience implementing, configuring, and scaling NetSuite environments in complex or high-growth SaaS organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on expertise with SuiteScript (1.0/2.x), SuiteFlow, SuiteBuilder, integrations/APIs, and NetSuite data model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Zone Advanced Billing (ZAB), including usage-based billing, rating, invoicing workflows, and integration with revenue and financial processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: NetSuite certifications (SuiteFoundation, Administrator, SuiteCloud Developer, ERP Consultant)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience building and maintaining integrations using Boomi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of designing and delivering scalable, multi-system architectures within the NetSuite ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading end-to-end system ownership, from architecture and implementation through optimization and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the order-to-cash / quote-to-cash process within NetSuite and connected systems, including pricing, billing, revenue recognition, and the contract lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate ambiguous business requirements into pragmatic, scalable NetSuite solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of quote-to-cash and order-to-cash processes within NetSuite, including Zone Advanced Billing, complex pricing models, subscription billing, invoicing, and revenue workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working in NetSuite OneWorld environments, including multi-subsidiary design, intercompany transactions, and global financial operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work across finance, operations, and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the intentional integration of AI and automation capabilities (e.g., workflow automation, intelligent integrations) to drive operational efficiency and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong adherence to SDLC best practices, ensuring disciplined design, development, testing, and deployment of solutions with a focus on quality, scalability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
