&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain scalable backend systems for our customer-facing products, ensuring high performance and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to build applications that support multi-channel communications for marketers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and optimize systems that process and deliver billions of messages daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve code quality through code reviews, testing, and advocating for best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address technical debt to ensure the long-term health of our codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural design and technical decisions, and stay current with emerging technologies to enhance our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
